    "Engineering Logging It must be possible to log engineering data at up to 200 Hz rates for short periods of time. This data must be available to external software packages for analysis. Long-term logging of engineering data must be possible at slower (1 Hz or less) rates, into a common format (baselined as SYBASE)."
